      "content": "that's a great start for the intro. for the next section, i need to address the counter-arguments so the paper looks balanced. can you help me write a paragraph that discusses the meritocracy argument—basically the idea that wealth should be based on individual effort and talent—and then show how that idea fails to account for systemic racism? i want to make sure the critique of meritocracy feels really robust in the essay.",
